<title>SWEDEN: Skanska wins Nordic orders of 750 mln skr.</title>
<headline>Skanska wins Nordic orders of 750 mln skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction and property company Skanska AB on Tuesday said it had taken new orders in recent weeks in the Nordic region worth about 750 million crowns.</p>
</text>
